    "name": "\u5e9e\u52a0\u83b1\u56de\u5f52  Poincar\u00e9 Recurrence",
    "steam_appid": 3576910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello there! This is a sci-fi RPG indie game :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Sci-fi Mystery Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/8dc4572061f5fbb9bc321090d3b9e125.poster.avif?t=1747381167\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/8dc4572061f5fbb9bc321090d3b9e125.webm?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/8dc4572061f5fbb9bc321090d3b9e125.mp4?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set against a modern sci-fi backdrop infused with philosophical contemplation, the game invites players to explore and gain insight into the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A second moon appears in the sky, a massive research facility hidden underground, recurring dreams, and eerie colleagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you listen to the voice in your head, or trust your own judgment based on what you see and hear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Story Background Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/59165493494b3b0ee665f8f12fef5c15.poster.avif?t=1747381167\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/59165493494b3b0ee665f8f12fef5c15.webm?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/59165493494b3b0ee665f8f12fef5c15.mp4?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A global flood has devastated coastal research facilities, and players arrive at a post-disaster reconstruction project site.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your friend, who helped you get the job at the project, suddenly brings you a chilling piece of news.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Gameplay Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/ef65f86886fa9c24292ea6af67a4c832.poster.avif?t=1747381167\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/ef65f86886fa9c24292ea6af67a4c832.webm?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/ef65f86886fa9c24292ea6af67a4c832.mp4?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the God rolling the dice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By taking on the roles of different characters, uncover the truth behind the mystery and shape the story of this world through your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Characters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/374ab640755c1d0970e074bfc3d595be.poster.avif?t=1747381167\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/374ab640755c1d0970e074bfc3d595be.webm?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/374ab640755c1d0970e074bfc3d595be.mp4?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Character Role-Playing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control more than one character to gain a comprehensive and three-dimensional understanding of the entire story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/326e4ce009303d979f7827ffae3a3a6d.avif?t=1747381167\" width=205 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bu Guai</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the game, Bu Guai, is an average individual who struggled to find a job due to the economic downturn after the disaster. She was later introduced by He Xi, a senior executive at the project's headquarters, to work as a technician at the construction site. As for why He Xi treats Bu Guai so well, explaining it solely with charisma seems a bit far-fetched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/6e898d3a5553d4281c330df80abc4bd5.avif?t=1747381167\" width=205 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chen Qingshan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the great flood, the online records of many people were destroyed, and Chen Qingshan was among them. Almost no one knows what his qualifications are, yet he managed to secure this job quite effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/a7919af5c67d1b31d674810e59de8fbb.avif?t=1747381167\" width=205 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He Xi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leader at the project's headquarters, He Xi is somehow very familiar with Bu Guai and easily became friends with her, as if they had been friends for a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello there! This is a sci-fi RPG indie game :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Sci-fi Mystery Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/8dc4572061f5fbb9bc321090d3b9e125.poster.avif?t=1747381167\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/8dc4572061f5fbb9bc321090d3b9e125.webm?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/8dc4572061f5fbb9bc321090d3b9e125.mp4?t=1747381167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set against a modern sci-fi backdrop infused with philosophical contemplation, the game invites players to explore and gain insight into the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A second moon appears in the sky, a massive research facility hidden underground, recurring dreams, and eerie colleagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you listen to the voice in your head, or trust your own judgment based on what you see and hear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Story Background Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/59165493494b3b0ee665f8f12fef5c15.poster.avif?t=1747