s headquarters, to work as a technician at the construction site. As for why He Xi treats Bu Guai so well, explaining it solely with charisma seems a bit far-fetched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/6e898d3a5553d4281c330df80abc4bd5.avif?t=1747381167\" width=205 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chen Qingshan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the great flood, the online records of many people were destroyed, and Chen Qingshan was among them. Almost no one knows what his qualifications are, yet he managed to secure this job quite effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576910/extras/a7919af5c67d1b31d674810e59de8fbb.avif?t=1747381167\" width=205 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He Xi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leader at the project's headquarters, He Xi is somehow very familiar with Bu Guai and easily became friends with her, as if they had been friends for a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p>",
